.lake/
# ⚠ `.venv*`, not `.venv` — the exact pattern is what let a 1.1 GB venv BACKUP into history.
# `.venv-iree-april-backup/` was swept into c942f5ce (5,383 files alongside 14 real ones) by a
# broad `git add`, rode 49 unpushed commits, and was only caught when GitHub rejected the push on
# its two >100 MB `.so` files. Stripped with filter-branch 2026-08-03. The glob covers any future
# `.venv-<whatever>` the same way.
.venv*
data/
__pycache__/

# Blueprint build artifacts
blueprint/web/
blueprint/print/
blueprint/lean_decls
blueprint/src/*.aux
blueprint/src/*.paux
blueprint/src/*.out
blueprint/src/*.toc
blueprint/src/*.pdf
blueprint/src/*.fls
blueprint/src/*.fdb_latexmk
blueprint/src/*.xdv
blueprint/src/*.synctex.gz

# Training logs — ignore at root, curated ones live under logs/ or runs/
*.log
!logs/*.log
!runs/**/*.log

# Documents
*.docx

# FFI build artifacts
ffi/*.o
ffi/*.so
ffi/test_ffi
ffi/test_ffi_so

# MLIR/IREE compiled modules and test data
mlir_poc/*.vmfb
mlir_poc/inputs/
mlir_poc/inputs_trained/
mlir_poc/cnn128/
mlir_poc/cnn_inputs/
mlir_poc/__pycache__/
jax/.venv

# brats-predict writes PPM here by default; only the converted PNG is tracked
# (demos/figures has always been PNG-only — see demos/README.md).
demos/figures/*.ppm

# Demo inference dumps moved from figures/ to runs/ (2026-07-26). The logit
# dumps are large and regenerable; curated .ppm/.png/.log/.tsv stay tracked.
runs/**/*.bin
